  "notes": "Modified cash basis school district. Governmental lines from Total Governmental Funds column (p5), which is already net of the Eliminations column (350,000 interfund transfer eliminated against General Fund pupil transportation 300,000 and extracurricular 50,000). The printed 'Transfer to other funds' 170,000 (to the Nutrition fund) is in transfers_out, not disbursements; printed total disbursements 8,842,857 includes it. Beginning/ending cash = fund balances Aug 31 2024/2025 (cash and county treasurer cash). Business-type = Nutrition Fund (p6-7); transfer from General Fund 170,000 in transfers_net; printed nonoperating total 170,403 includes it, so business-type receipts total computed as 203,113. Balance sheet uses Statement of Net Position cash basis Total column (governmental plus nutrition). Detail: General Fund budget schedule p8 (pupil transportation shown net of 300,000 hidden transfer to Depreciation Fund per p5 elimination, contra other financing line added; the 220,000 'Transfer to other funds' includes 170,000 to Nutrition and 50,000 to Activity Fund); Building p9; QCPU p10; Depreciation, Employee Benefit, Activity, Student Fee funds from combining statement p11. Zero-actual lines kept for budget. No double counting. Read pages 1-11 of 11"
}